<div class="sg-flow"><div><h3>Check the connection.</h3><p>Listen for delay, clipped openings and wrong connections. For parallel calling, check how the tool handles two people answering at once and where those records go next.</p></div><div><h3>Follow the callback.</h3><p>Call the displayed number back. Check who receives it, whether the rep can find the record and how the next action appears in the CRM.</p></div><div><h3>Review the outcome.</h3><p>Count qualified conversations, next steps and meetings that were held. Track rep time and total cost alongside attempts so speed has a useful purpose.</p></div></div>
